```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "measure a spirit's slots, or fold one line into the ash ledger"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.spirit.folds", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.spirit.folds"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.spirit.folds"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.spirit.folds ~ hum ~ what remains after the fold

Bare `lares spirit hum <pet>` measures each slot against its budget and prints the carrier the wiki folds at `aperture=` (default `pulse`), a shrine's or a lone card's. `fold='#/<slot>'` lists the slot's lines with each line's digest; `line=<n> expect=<digest>` moves that line to the month's ash ledger, found by content, so a sibling's write between the listing and the fold folds the line this instance chose or nothing. The fold burns the line only once the patch lands. `instance=` names the folding instance.


`hum <pet> streams=` folds the pet's settled stream entries (no stream's head, seen by their addressee, answered by no unseen entry) into one line per stream on `slot=` (default `#/open`), then tags each `ash-ready` beside a `folded` field naming the slot: marked for o-takiage, never deleted.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ measure · list · fold

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`measure` params=`pet/lares-alpha ~ measure each slot`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`list` params=`pet/lares-alpha fold/#/open ~ list the slot's lines with their digests`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`fold` params=`pet/lares-alpha fold/#/open line/3 expect/<digest> ~ fold one line to the ash ledger`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ face · pet · aperture · fold · line · expect · instance

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/face`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`pet` params=`takes/pet-name needs/required seat/1 as/<pet> ~ the spirit's pet name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`aperture` params=`takes/rank default/pulse ~ the fold's grain`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`fold` params=`takes/slot-path ~ the slot whose lines list or fold`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`line` params=`takes/n ~ beside fold, the listed line to move`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`expect` params=`takes/digest ~ beside line, the listed line's digest (16 hex)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`instance` params=`takes/session-id ~ the folding instance`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`streams` params=`takes/flag ~ fold the pet's settled stream entries, one line per stream on slot= (default #/open), each tagged ash-ready`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ocap/write-on-the-daemon-wiki ~ the ledger append and the slot patch ride the tiddler door`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · spirit-pet-malformed · spirit-unknown · spirit-fold-gone · spirit-ashes-refused · spirit-crossing · spirit-write-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.folds pet/lares-alpha fold/#/open]] ~ line= without fold=, or without expect=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-pet-malformed` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.folds pet/lares-alpha]] ~ the word reads as no pet name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-unknown` params=`~ no record or card answers the pet`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-fold-gone` params=`cure/[[face.spirit.folds pet/lares-alpha fold/#/open]] ~ the line moved or left since the listing`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-ashes-refused` params=`~ the ash ledger refused the append`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-crossing` params=`~ the instance stands mid-crossing`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`spirit-write-refused` params=`~ the tiddler door answered no put`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ measured · folded

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`measured` params=`exit/0 fields/[[pet uri kind]] ~ each slot's size and budget, or the folded carrier`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`folded` params=`exit/0 ~ the line rests in the ash ledger; what stays reads as the card`>>
```

